{
  "slug": "gemini-for-claude",
  "name": "Gemini For Claude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bridge Claude Code to Google's Gemini CLI. Mirrors the pattern of the official Codex plugin but for Google's AI stack. Adds 9 slash commands under /gemini: for code review, adversarial security review with CVE search, web-grounded research via Google Search (capability Codex lacks), task delegation with 1M-token context, image generation via nanobanana, and background job management. Supports Google OAuth (free tier), API key, and Vertex AI auth. Zero npm dependencies — one auditable Node.js ESM companion script.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install gemini-for-claude@claude-community` from `philipvanlewis/gemini-for-claude`.\n\nThe missing Gemini plugin for Claude Code. Review code, research the web, delegate tasks, and generate images -- all from Claude Code using Google's Gemini CLI.",
